  triage:title "Sprint doc's 'no file overlap with BB.2' claim is false; status fields flipped by dev instead of lead" ;
  triage:description "quality-mgr QA1-B6 + fenix critical review I6, reviewed at 27e21224c. The sprint doc's header table (L15) claims 'File overlap with BB.1, BB.2: none ... BB.2 touches .claude/skills/**' (implying BB.3 does not). The actual diff shows BB.3 itself edits .claude/skills/html-report/templates/fuzz-run-report.html.j2 (+6 lines: new procedure_label/procedure_href frontmatter defaults and a conditional 'Procedure:' link block) -- a real, non-trivial edit inside BB.2's claimed exclusive territory, confirmed via git diff origin/integrate/phase-bb...HEAD. Also templates/benchmark-report/benchmark-run.xhtml.j2 is an undeclared out-of-footprint edit. Separately, docs/plans/phase-bb/sprint-BB.3-test-procedure-pages.md:2 and docs/project-plan.md:1829 were flipped to 'complete' by the dev; BB.7 owns project-plan and status is set by the lead at closure, not the dev mid-sprint -- both to be reverted in the fix round." ;
